This project adapts code from PyaesoneP/vlm-ocr-research (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/PyaesoneP/vlm-ocr-research
Source commit: fd4bd0ae44db0f57f7dcb0e301a0a718d3e6159f

Adapted components: benchmark/metrics.py (whitespace normalization and
Levenshtein scoring), scripts/crop_handwritten.py and
scripts/generate_ground_truth.py (IAM handwritten-region extraction).

Modifications include local Ollama inference, folder-based dataset validation,
reference overrides, reproducible manifests, edit-count aggregation, resumable
runs, and Excel/CSV/JSONL exports. The upstream model-specific environments,
cloud evaluation pipelines, dataset, and published results are not included.
